ype": "text", "content": "Make sure these lines are at the end of your LaTeX document, and it will add a references section citing all of your sources (assuming “citations.bib” is your BibTeX file with your references):"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.114, 0.385, 0.783, 0.44], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "\\bibliographystyle{plainurl} % Specify the bibliography style here \\bibliography{citations} % Generates the “References”/bibliography section \\end{document} % the last line of the LaTeX file; THIS SHOULD ALREADY EXIST"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.113, 0.457, 0.678, 0.476], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "You may also need to "}, {"type": "text", "content": "use the xurl package", "styles": ["underline"]}, {"type": "text", "content": " to properly render URLs."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.114, 0.478, 0.561, 0.496], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "The instructions below walk through each step in detail."}]}, {"type": "paragraph_title", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.115, 0.524, 0.432, 0.55], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "1. Generate a .bib file"}], "level": 2}, {"type": "text", "index": 11, "bbox": [0.112, 0.562, 0.856, 0.619], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Use the online website "}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "http://zbib.org", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "zbib.org"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": " or their free application, "}, {"type": "hyperlink", "url": "https://www.zotero.org/", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Zotero"}]}, {"type": "text", "content": " to generate a “.bib” file. Both of these solutions allow you to add all of your sources to a “.bib” file. (You can even add sources that you didn’t end up using, and Overleaf will make sure they don’t show up.)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 12, "bbox": [0.112, 0.635, 0.816, 0.673], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "On zbib.org, you generate a “.bib” file by clicking on the little down caret by the “Copy to Clipboard” button, and select “Download BibTeX”."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 13, "bbox": [0.163, 0.712, 0.461, 0.73], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Modern Language Association 9th edition"}]}, {"type": "image", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.14, 0.701, 0.866, 0.903], "content": [{"type": "image_body", "index": 14, "bbox": [0.14, 0.701, 0.866, 0.903], "content": ""}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 15, "bbox": [0.375, 0.865, 0.569, 0.888], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Copy to Clipboard"}]}]}, {"page_idx": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "index": 0, "bbox": [0.113, 0.09, 0.832, 0.127], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "On Zotero, you right click on your collection, select “Export Collection…”, set the format to “BibTeX”, and then press “OK” to save the file."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 1, "bbox": [0.126, 0.136, 0.18, 0.153], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Export..."}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 2, "bbox": [0.133, 0.166, 0.24, 0.184], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Format: BibTeX"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 3, "bbox": [0.138, 0.189, 0.255, 0.205], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Translator Options"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 4, "bbox": [0.143, 0.207, 0.246, 0.225], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Export Notes"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 5, "bbox": [0.144, 0.226, 0.236, 0.244], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Export Files"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 6, "bbox": [0.143, 0.265, 0.315, 0.283], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Use Journal Abbreviation"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 7, "bbox": [0.141, 0.29, 0.266, 0.306], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Character Encoding:"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 8, "bbox": [0.142, 0.31, 0.245, 0.326], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "Unicode (UTF-8)"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 9, "bbox": [0.248, 0.345, 0.272, 0.36], "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "OK"}]}, {"type": "text", "index": 10, "bbox": [0.333,